**Convention 1.1 (reference input and authorship).** This volume contains
ordinary mathematics over finite trees and rational fields. It supplies no
new Lean proof, kernel certification or empirical certification. Lean
declarations, where cited, retain their own hypotheses and verification
boundary. Mathematical exposition is by one external Codex CLI theory
author using `formal-thinking-and-answer` and `theory-volume-template`;
the cited existing sources supply the results expressly attributed to them.
The mode is single-author source synthesis and ordinary proof, without
delegated mathematical coauthors. That description asserts neither an
independent review result nor independence of model priors.

